1
00:00:14,960 --> 00:00:21,840
What are you doing?
Playing a game… can't you see?

2
00:00:21,840 --> 00:00:26,787
Are you messing with me?
Go take a shower. Now.

3
00:00:26,787 --> 00:00:28,574
I don't have clothes.

4
00:00:29,159 --> 00:00:33,439
Then grab some. My closet's full.

5
00:00:33,439 --> 00:00:40,783
Go, Earth. Earth!
Hurry up and take a damn shower!

6
00:00:40,925 --> 00:00:45,684
Damn—
What the hell is this?

7
00:01:02,280 --> 00:01:04,756
Kan, I'm wearing this one, okay?

8
00:01:04,756 --> 00:01:07,596
Yeah, wear whatever you want.

9
00:01:07,596 --> 00:01:09,708
Earth.

10
00:01:10,240 --> 00:01:11,692
Not that one. Take it off.

11
00:01:12,879 --> 00:01:14,243
Why?

12
00:01:14,243 --> 00:01:17,245
Because I said no.
No means no.

13
00:01:17,759 --> 00:01:21,134
But you just said I could wear anything!

14
00:01:21,595 --> 00:01:27,079
God, you're so stubborn, you little—
I said take it off!

15
00:01:27,079 --> 00:01:30,079
Go.

16
00:01:38,799 --> 00:01:43,680
Hello, Tawan? You in your room?

17
00:01:44,200 --> 00:01:46,545
Give me your phone.
Where are you going?

18
00:01:47,750 --> 00:01:49,366
My business.

19
00:01:49,366 --> 00:01:51,000
Take the shirt off.

20
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:52,895
What is your deal with this shirt?!

21
00:01:55,341 --> 00:01:58,432
Do you not get it? I said take it off!

22
00:01:59,850 --> 00:02:01,157
Why do I have to?

23
00:02:01,157 --> 00:02:03,943
Because I said you can't wear it.
Take it off.

24
00:02:05,520 --> 00:02:09,159
I'm not taking it off.

25
00:02:12,580 --> 00:02:17,076
Fine. Whatever.
Do whatever the hell you want.

26
00:02:17,076 --> 00:02:19,754
Wear it then. Damn it.

27
00:02:21,207 --> 00:02:23,275
Because that shirt belongs to Maprang.
